# Audit-driven integration suites. They assert on the private planning documents
# above (spec tasks, evidence manifest, audit report), so they cannot run against
# a clone that does not contain them. The reusable protocol fixtures under
# bin/cli/tests/fixtures/ ARE published, because bin/cli/Cargo.toml declares
# them as [[bin]] targets and the workspace does not build without them.
bin/cli/tests/task*.rs
bin/cli/tests/*.proptest-regressions
bin/cli/tests/fixtures/task10_report_language.hi.md